This is Survex, a software package to assist surveying and mapping cave
systems.

See INSTALL for how to install it.

## Embedding cavern

The `cavern` reducer is now available as a library target named `cavernlib`.
Link your project against it (or add the target as a dependency if you use the
top-level CMake project) and include `src/cavern_lib.h`.  Call
`cavern_run(argc, argv)` with the same argument vector you would pass to the
CLI.  The reducer still works entirely via file I/O, so arguments and output
paths should match the command-line usage.  The function returns the usual exit
codes (0 for success, non-zero for failures) and never terminates the host
process.  On Windows, call `cavern_pause_if_requested()` after `cavern_run` if
you want to honour the `--pause` switch.
